------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party dependencies
------------------------------------------------------------------------

Handoff is built on the Strands Agents SDK and uses the libraries below.
None of their source is vendored into this repository; each is installed
from its own distribution and remains under its own licence.

  strands-agents            Apache-2.0    https://strandsagents.com
  strands-agents-tools      Apache-2.0
  bedrock-agentcore         Apache-2.0    (optional: AWS deployment)
  boto3 / botocore          Apache-2.0    (optional: AWS)
  anthropic                 MIT           (optional: Anthropic provider)
  openai                    Apache-2.0    (optional: Groq / OpenAI-compatible)
  mcp                       MIT
  mcp-server-fetch          MIT           (optional: credential-free web tool)
  fastapi                   MIT
  starlette                 BSD-3-Clause
  uvicorn                   BSD-3-Clause
  jinja2                    BSD-3-Clause
  pydantic                  MIT
  httpx                     BSD-3-Clause
  python-dotenv             BSD-3-Clause
  PyYAML                    MIT
  json-repair               MIT
  pywebview                 BSD-3-Clause  (optional: desktop window)
  rich                      MIT           (the command line)
  Markdown                  BSD-3-Clause  (the guides)
  amazon-transcribe         Apache-2.0    (optional: streaming speech on AWS)
  sounddevice               MIT           (optional: microphone from the terminal and the desktop window)
  google-auth               Apache-2.0    (optional: Google Calendar)
  google-auth-oauthlib      Apache-2.0    (optional: Google Calendar)

Services Handoff talks to over their own public APIs. No SDK is vendored and
no code of theirs is included; each is reached with httpx and a credential the
user supplies.

  Gmail, Google Calendar    Google APIs
  Linear                    GraphQL API
  Slack                     Web API
  GitHub                    REST API + remote MCP server
  Notion                    REST API (Notion-Version 2022-06-28)
  Telegram                  Bot API
  Airtable                  REST API

Served to the browser from a CDN, not redistributed here:

  htmx                      BSD-2-Clause
  Instrument Sans, Comfortaa, JetBrains Mono   SIL Open Font License 1.1 (Google Fonts)

------------------------------------------------------------------------
Adapted work
------------------------------------------------------------------------

Two pieces were adapted, not copied. No file from either project is in
this repository; both are MIT licensed.

  The orb's WebGL fragment shader (src/handoff/web/static/orb.js) is
  adapted from DORA's volumetric orb, with a transparent background and
  audio-reactive uniforms added.
    DORA — MIT — https://github.com/Aaditya1273/DORA

  The visual language of the app and the site (the oklch cream palette,
  the glass and accent surfaces, the drift wall and the clipped footer
  wordmark) is re-expressed from Agent.md's site against Handoff's own
  design tokens.
    Agent.md — MIT — https://github.com/Aaditya1273/Agent.md

Terminal screenshots in docs/screens were rendered with freeze
(charmbracelet, MIT) in Cascadia Code (Microsoft, SIL OFL 1.1).
